                                "sense_id": "15264457-5168-351f-b322-da02175307a6",
                                "text": "Dogtanian, an endearingly gauche puppy from Gascony, travels to Paris to join the King's Own Guard, falling in love en route with the beautiful Juliette, but eventually teaming up with swordsters Athos, Porthos and Aramis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa2797cd-4971-4313-beff-4642503c50e2",
                                "sense_id": "15264457-5168-351f-b322-da02175307a6",
                                "text": "“Not in the Dales themselves, though they are restless—there have been two blood feuds between kin clans since the Year Turning, and Imry has his hands full with these hot-tempered swordsters. […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb57afc3-97b9-4b50-b0e0-b44f6c604699",
                                "sense_id": "15264457-5168-351f-b322-da02175307a6",
                                "text": "A boy magician, aided by various ogres and swordster Svenson battles an all-powerful wizard for control of his kingdom."
                            }
